      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【胜利夺得沙特联冠军】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-22/match1784598date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">C罗首夺沙特联！利雅得胜利4-1达马克夺冠 C罗任意球破门+双响</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260522/zhanbao_image_1784598_1779392618_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260522/zhanbao_image_1784598_1779392618_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260522/zhanbao_image_1784598_1779392618_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">利雅得胜利4-1达马克2分优势夺冠，C罗首次夺得沙特联冠军，同时收获个人第37座冠军，职业生涯进球数达到973球。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-22/6a0f27876433anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">🏆胜利即冠军！利雅得胜利夺第11座联赛冠军，C罗获沙特联首冠</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-22/6a0f25938fc0dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">🏆终问鼎！C罗首夺沙特联冠军，加盟3年半获首个主要赛事冠军</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-22/6a0f155da2996native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">传奇继续！🏆41岁C罗生涯已夺37冠：俱乐部34冠，国家队3冠</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-22/6a0f667574944native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">👀下个赛季就？C罗生涯973球距千球大关27球，本赛季俱乐部30球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/6a037b622d367.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/6a037b622d367.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/6a037b622d367.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">本赛季C罗代表利雅得胜利征战沙特联30场比赛，打进28球，送出3次助攻，持续保持高效竞技状态，助力球队登顶联赛。这也是C罗加盟球队后，首次斩获沙特联联赛冠军。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-22/6a0f650c2fd0dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">斩获生涯第37冠！C罗社媒晒夺冠个人海报：冠军！！！！🏆</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260522/202605220438419600.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260522/202605220438419600.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260522/202605220438419600.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">赛后第一时间，C罗的社媒发布了夺冠海报，配文：冠军！！！！🏆 🟡🔵</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-22/6a0f6ad351b38native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">金色的雨！C罗以队长身份捧起沙特联冠军奖杯，全队激情庆祝</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-22/6a0f6f8d619fenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">有何深意？C罗指着冠军奖杯摇了摇手，摊手并做洒水动作</a></p><p><strong>【英格兰名单遭大规模泄露】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-22/6a0f405557cf4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英格兰名单遭英媒大规模泄露：马奎尔等多人落选，35岁亨德森入选</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.4" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251107/690de68e7b722.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.4" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.4" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251107/690de68e7b722.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251107/690de68e7b722.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">今日下午英格兰将公布参加本届美加墨世界杯的阵容名单，目前该名单的多处选择已经得到各家英媒的爆料，含亚当·沃顿、马奎尔、福登等人在内的多位英格兰球员都将落选。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-21/6a0f27bd3526fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英媒：33岁马奎尔落选英格兰世界杯大名单，球员感到既失落又震惊</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-22/6a0f2c845aa2cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马奎尔自宣落选世界杯名单：原本自信能入选，落选让我震惊且失落</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.82" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260522/202605220027365722.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.82" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.82" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260522/202605220027365722.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260522/202605220027365722.jpg"> </div><p>最具关注度的是曼联中卫马奎尔的落选，球员在消息传出的第一时间就自己发布声明，自宣无缘世界杯。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-22/6a0f759ca00a4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">遭大规模泄露！BBC预测英格兰名单：凯恩领衔，福登、马奎尔落选</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260522/202605220514091177.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260522/202605220514091177_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260522/202605220514091177_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">BBC根据泄露结果整理了一份预测的英格兰本届世界杯参赛名单，其中还有一席空缺。</span></p><p><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">【其他新闻】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-22/6a0f212aeec5bnative.htm" target="_blank" weib