制了告别采访视频，在采访中他谈到球迷时动情落泪。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-21/6a0f1e31942fanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">推文称“红军已决定解雇斯洛特”，信源极度不可靠已引发大量质疑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.93" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260521/202605212303482729.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.93" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.93" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260521/202605212303482729.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260521/202605212303482729.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">一位号称是“体育记者”的外国博主爆出所谓“独家消息”，称利物浦董事会已经决定炒掉斯洛特。</span><strong>这条推文引发了不少国内外利物浦球迷的关注，但这条所谓的独家消息信源并不可靠、已引发大量质疑。</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">虽然很多球迷都希望斯洛特下课，但综合各方消息这条内容目前看大概率是爆假料。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-22/6a0f3050c7b7bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">跟队记者：尽管外界谣言四起，但利物浦对斯洛特的立场仍没有改变</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-22/6a0f4823a57ddnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">网传伊劳拉接任斯洛特？罗马诺：赛季末复盘才会决定是否换斯洛特</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.61" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260516/6a07961710bb1_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.61" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-999